{
  "name": "石狮怒吼，海鸟飞天",
  "status": "structured",
  "timeframe": "1d",
  "source_pages": [129, 130],
  "source": "石狮怒吼、海鸟飞天描述庄家先故意破坏图形，制造均线与指标死叉的空头陷阱，然后某一天突然放出巨量长阳，快速修复图形并接近或冲过前头部。",
  "source_summary": "若此前存在均线空头破坏，随后出现巨量长阳并突破前头部，可视为石狮怒吼、海鸟飞天。",
  "comment": "当前主规则聚焦‘先破坏、后巨量修复’这一核心，其他KD、RSI、MACD描述未纳入。",
  "computable_from_daily_ocvhl": true,
  "required_fields": ["open", "close", "volume"],
  "warmup_bars": 100,
  "indicator_type": "volume_price_rule",
  "params": {
    "ma_fast_window": 5,
    "ma_mid_window": 10,
    "ma_slow_window": 20,
    "head_lookback": 40,
    "volume_lookback": 60,
    "background_lookback": 20,
    "background_min_bearish_days": 5,
    "signal_keep_days": 3
  },
  "series": [
    {
      "id": "ma_fast",
      "op": "sma",
      "field": "close",
      "window": "$params.ma_fast_window",
      "description": "5日均线"
    },
    {
      "id": "ma_mid",
      "op": "sma",
      "field": "close",
      "window": "$params.ma_mid_window",
      "description": "10日均线"
    },
    {
      "id": "ma_slow",
      "op": "sma",
      "field": "close",
      "window": "$params.ma_slow_window",
      "description": "20日均线"
    },
    {
      "id": "head_close_high",
      "op": "highest",
      "field": "close",
      "window": "$params.head_lookback",
      "description": "前头部最高收盘价近似"
    },
    {
      "id": "head_close_high_prev",
      "op": "ref",
      "field": "head_close_high",
      "window": 1,
      "description": "前一日的头部最高收盘价"
    },
    {
      "id": "volume_high_lookback",
      "op": "highest",
      "field": "volume",
      "window": "$params.volume_lookback",
      "description": "最近N日最大成交量"
    },
    {
      "id": "volume_high_prev",
      "op": "ref",
      "field": "volume_high_lookback",
      "window": 1,
      "description": "前一日最近N日最大成交量"
    }
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "id": "volume_roar",
      "op": "breakout_up",
      "left": "volume",
      "right": "volume_high_prev",
      "description": "巨量怒吼日"
    },
    {
      "id": "repair_breakout",
      "op": "breakout_up",
      "left": "close",
      "right": "head_close_high_prev",
      "description": "长阳修复并突破前头部"
    }
  ],
  "rules": {
    "latest_match": {
      "op": "within",
      "window": "$params.signal_keep_days",
      "condition": {
        "op": "and",
        "conditions": [
          {
            "op": "before",
            "condition": {
              "op": "and",
              "conditions": [
                {"op": "compare", "left": "ma_fast", "operator": "<=", "right": "ma_mid"},
                {"op": "compare", "left": "ma_mid", "operator": "<=", "right": "ma_slow"}
              ]
            },
            "event": "volume_roar",
            "window": "$params.background_lookback",
            "min_count": "$params.background_min_bearish_days"
          },
          {"op": "condition", "event": "volume_roar"},
          {"op": "condition", "event": "repair_breakout"},
          {"op": "compare", "left": "close", "operator": ">", "right": "open"}
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "calculation_steps": [
    "计算5日、10日、20日均线，识别是否存在一段均线空头破坏背景。",
    "检测成交量是否向上突破最近volume_lookback日的最大量能。",
    "要求同日收盘向上突破前头部最高收盘价，近似表达巨量长阳单日修好图形。"
  ],
  "signal_day_definition": "以巨量长阳修复图形并突破前头部的当日作为信号完成日。",
  "manual_review_needed": [
    "原文还提到KD、RSI、MACD等反技术破坏后再修复，当前只保留日线均线与量价主结构。",
    "‘接近前高点’当前被收敛为直接突破前头部最高收盘价，属于偏严格版本。"
  ],
  "implementation_notes": [
    "warmup_bars >= max(head_lookback, volume_lookback) + background_lookback + 1。",
    "如果后续需要更宽松版本，可增加‘接近前高但未突破’的参数化条件。"
  ],
  "explain": "石狮怒吼、海鸟飞天被结构化为先破坏均线结构，再以巨量长阳突破前头部的修复信号。"
}
